This product includes code adapted from RapidOCR 3.10.0
(https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
the text detection post-processing and the text line crop in src/tamra/ocr/geometry.py,
and the text detection and recognition pre- and post-processing in src/tamra/ocr/engine.py.

At the user's request, Tamra downloads the PP-OCRv5 mobile text detection and recognition
models of PaddleOCR (https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, in the ONNX form published by RapidAI.

The Linux package (tamra_<version>_amd64.deb) also contains Qt and PySide6 (Qt for Python,
https://www.qt.io/), used under the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3
(LGPL-3.0-only). Qt WebEngine includes Chromium, under BSD-style licenses.
